{"skill":{"slug":"academic-writing","displayName":"academic-writing"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1771139885210,"changelog":"Academic Writing Skill v1.0.0\n\n- Initial release offering specialized support for academic writing, including scholarly papers, literature reviews, research methodology, and thesis writing.\n- All outputs are produced in Markdown and encapsulated within <ama-doc></ama-doc> tags for clarity.\n- Strict adherence to academic integrity: only real, verifiable academic sources are cited; prohibited sources (e.g., blogs, Wikipedia, news) are excluded.\n- Clear citation and reference list formatting requirements, emphasizing numbered in-text citations and a standardized \"References\" section.\n- Comprehensive content structuring guidelines provided, including formal tone, technical precision, and explicit inclusion of diagrams or tables when appropriate.\n- Ensures language alignment with user queries and maintains consistency throughout the document.","changelogSource":"user","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":3634,"sha256":"8e79a712367c41d90a9940c5c31d6c88a7594f39dfcfa2d50b091f68be5ca5e7","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1562,"sha256":"a4fdf7cf352221fe6150f767d0323d9e1d5c9ae4c3892f48b9f564ec6ac10799","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789068425605,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"19a8225ca82940658f52d2079bbcaec72584522713ea7caf6b726572dc6e5de5","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/19a8225ca82940658f52d2079bbcaec72584522713ea7caf6b726572dc6e5de5","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: academic-writing\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe skill bundle contains standard metadata and a SKILL.md file that provides detailed instructions for an AI agent specializing in academic writing. The instructions focus on output format, academic integrity (e.g., 'Never fabricate data'), citation standards, content structure, and quality assurance. There are no indications of malicious intent, such as data exfiltration, unauthorized execution, persistence mechanisms, or prompt injection attempts designed to subvert the agent for harmful purposes. All content aligns with the stated purpose of an academic writing assistant.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779164171959},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1789068425605},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill only provides academic writing and citation-formatting guidance, with no code execution, credentials, persistence, or hidden data access.","dimensions":[{"detail":"No local file access, credential use, network calls, tool hijacking, or broad environment permissions are requested by the artifact.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The inspected artifact consists of a single Markdown skill file and no installer, scripts, dependencies, or executable components.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill strongly prescribes Markdown output and ama-doc tags for writing outputs, but this is disclosed formatting behavior aligned with its academic-writing purpose.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The artifact does not create persistence, modify agent memory, install services, change tools, or request elevated privileges.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The artifact's stated purpose is academic writing support, and its instructions are limited to scholarly tone, structure, citation quality, tables, and Mermaid diagrams.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Installers should understand that this skill will push the agent toward formal academic structure and stricter citation expectations, but the inspected artifact does not show security-sensitive behavior beyond ordinary writing guidance.","findings":null,"agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789068425605}}}}}